    "name": "Cloaked Protocol: Stealth Action Thriller",
    "steam_appid": 2738700,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738700/extras/5417c3d5b752e8b4dd88bef8c9ba5173.poster.avif?t=1747514487\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738700/extras/5417c3d5b752e8b4dd88bef8c9ba5173.webm?t=1747514487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738700/extras/5417c3d5b752e8b4dd88bef8c9ba5173.mp4?t=1747514487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738700/extras/b82a99950a0992cdca04be766ec01565.avif?t=1747514487\" data-has-big width=800 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cloaked Protocol</i> is a PS1-inspired stealth thriller set in a 1990s world ruled by retro-tech, physical data, and ruthless corporate power. Infiltrate black sites, manipulate analog systems, and uncover secrets too dangerous to digitize. With Metroidvania-style progression and no hand-holding, every tool, every locked door, and every choice matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738700/extras/a23b57eb3625be3216029ee74628fe73.avif?t=1747514487\" data-has-big width=800 height=74 /></span>You play as Jack, a retired special operative pulled back for one final mission. What begins as a simple infiltration spirals into a deepening conspiracy\u2014one that ties Jack\u2019s old squad, a rogue nuclear facility, and a dying girl into something far more sinister. Surveillance is manual. Data is physical. And trust is in short supply.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738700/extras/7e2bdd1011abb7d9e671d276ca2c16ae.avif?t=1747514487\" data-has-big width=800 height=74 /></span>Sneak through shadowy industrial hubs, reroute power grids, find keycards, and eavesdrop on guard chatter. Avoid combat when you can\u2014but if things go loud, you\u2019ll need to fight smart or die trying. Explore interconnected environments, solve puzzles, and uncover hidden routes. Every system is built for hands-on espionage in a 1990s retro tech world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Updates &amp; Community:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738700/extras/facec6392a8229020874412e61e6ada6.avif?t=1747514487\" data-has-big width=800 height=74 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738700/extras/5417c3d5b752e8b4dd88bef8c9ba5173.poster.avif?t=1747514487\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738700/extras/5417c3d5b752e8b4dd88bef8c9ba5173.webm?t=1747514487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738700/extras/5417c3d5b752e8b4dd88bef8c9ba5173.mp4?t=1747514487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738700/extras/b82a99950a0992cdca04be766ec01565.avif?t=1747514487\" data-has-big width=800 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Cloaked Protocol</i> is a PS1-inspired stealth thriller set in a 1990s world ruled by retro-tech, physical data, and ruthless corporate power. Infiltrate black sites, manipulate analog systems, and uncover secrets too dangerous to digitize. With Metroidvania-style progression and no hand-holding, every tool, every locked door, and every choice matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738700/extras/a23b57eb3625be3216029ee74628fe73.avif?t=1747514487\" data-has-big width=800 height=74 /></span>You play as Jack, a retired special operative pulled back for one final mission. What begins as a simple infiltration spirals into a deepening conspiracy\u2014one that ties Jack\u2019s old squad, a rogue nuclear facility, and a dying girl into something far more sinister. Surveillance is manual. Data is physical. And trust is in short supply.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738700/extras/7e2bdd1011abb7d9e671d276ca2c16ae.avif?t=1747514487\" data-has-big width=800 height=74 /></span>Sneak through shadowy industrial hubs, reroute power grids, find keycards, and eavesdrop on guard chatter. Avoid combat when you can\u2014but if things go loud, you\u2019ll need to fight smart or die trying. Explore interconnected environments, solve puzzles, and uncover hidden routes. Every system is built for hands-on espionage in a 1990s retro tech world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Updates &amp; Community:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2738700/extras/facec6392a8229020874412e61e6ada6.avif?t=1747514487\" data-has-big width=800 height=74 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "A PlayStation 1-inspired stealth thriller set in a 1990s world dominated by corporate power. Step into the shadows as Jack, an elite operative sent to infiltrate, investigate, and neutralize the threat behind NeuraCorp\u2019s illegal experiments.",
